	"info": {
		"title": "WhatsApp Neo API",
		"version": "2.0.0",
		"description": "REST API for WhatsApp via whatsapp-web.js + remote Chromium CDP.\n\nAuth scheme split by endpoint type:\n- `/auth/*`     → Authorization: Basic <base64> (system credentials, obtain a JWT)\n- `/single/*`   → Authorization: Bearer <JWT>    (per-user state)\n- `/health`     → no auth required\n\nSee the Auth section for how to obtain a JWT via /auth/login or /auth/signup.",
		"contact": {}
	},
