				"description": "Download media attached to a message.\nReturns the raw binary data with the correct Content-Type header.\nThe `id` parameter is the message's serialized ID (e.g. \"true_16073041892@c.us_3EB0F1F3ABC\").\n\n0.2: Use",
				"tags": [
